MUTUAL NON-DISCLOSURE AGREEMENT (NDA)
Sovereign Commercial Confidentiality Agreement
Governing Law: Sovereign Jurisdiction | Made by: Abhinav Giri

This Mutual Non-Disclosure Agreement ("Agreement") is entered into as of this day between:
Disclosing Party: Abhinav Giri / Giri Orbit Sovereign Technologies (abhinavgiri370@gmail.com)
and
Receiving Party: Authorized Corporate Counterparty

1. DEFINITION OF CONFIDENTIAL INFORMATION
Confidential Information includes all proprietary software source code, architectural schematics, financial matrices, mathematical algorithms, and universal .giri file specifications disclosed by either party.

2. OBLIGATIONS OF RECEIVING PARTY
The Receiving Party agrees to:
a) Hold all Confidential Information in strictest confidence using at least reasonable care.
b) Not disclose, publish, or disseminate any Confidential Information to third parties without prior written consent.
c) Restrict disclosure strictly to personnel with a clear need to know.

3. DATA SOVEREIGNTY & STORAGE
No Confidential Information shall be transmitted to or stored on unencrypted public cloud services or unauthorized third-party infrastructure.

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, the parties have executed this Agreement.

